Diagnostics from the same fixture:

```
leaves by lod { "0": 16, "1": 8, "2": 1 }  total 25   // 2:1 balance collapsed the lod-3 quadrant to lod 2
raw      { hash: '426e2973', triangles: 800, vertices: 449 }   // 800 tris, cracks present
